<title>JAPAN: Shinko Wire - 96/97 parent results.</title>
<headline>Shinko Wire - 96/97 parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 26.15		vs	   27.36</p>
<p> Operating	  390    million    vs	    1.30</p>
<p> Current	    267    million    vs	    1.25</p>
